        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "Elizabeth is so overwhelmed by everything that Mr Darcy has done for Elizabeth and her family that she cannot sleep. She goes for a morning walk instead, and comes across Mr Darcy. There are no longer any issues or barriers preventing them from being together, so it's time for a betrothal. "
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
