    {
      "start_time": 160,
      "end_time": 184,
      "annotation": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "Elizabeth apologising for her behaviour and harsh judgement is what gives Mr Darcy hope that her feelings have changed, leading him to attempt another betrothal. "
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "Mr Darcy also confesses that everything he's done was for her, proving his feelings are more than just words."
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
