      "annotation": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "The betrothal scene also contains a declaration of love from Mr Darcy. He expresses his hopes for their future, but also gives Elizabeth the opportunity to back away, especially after his last proposal went quite badly. "
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "This time, the proposal is accepted - not in as many words, but there is something beautiful in their quiet moment together."
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
